{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Rebecca loses contact with her girlfriend Leanna during a late-night call, fear drives her to investigate. She heads to the Hemisfair Health Clinic, where Leanna was last heard from, only to discover she\u2019s vanished without a trace. As she digs deeper, she crosses paths with unsettling individuals whose actions raise more questions than answers. What begins as a desperate search for Leanna spirals into a harrowing journey to uncover the truth.<br><br><i><strong>Experience this gripping, story-driven third-person adventure where narrative takes center stage.</strong></i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/LR1.gif?t=1745014775\" /><br><i><strong>Investigate the Clinic During the Dead of Night: Embark on a tense late-night exploration of the Hemisfair Health Clinic to uncover the mystery behind Leanna\u2019s disappearance.</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/LR2.gif?t=1745014775\" /><i><strong></strong></i> <i><strong>Uncover secrets, and face tense encounters: Stay on your toes during high-stakes situations where your reactions can mean the difference between life and death.</strong></i>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/LR3.gif?t=1745014775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><br>Live the Story in San Antonio: Become part of the narrative as you explore San Antonio, TX, through the eyes of its characters and their challenges</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/LR4.gif?t=1745014775\" /><br><br><strong><i>Cinematic Storytelling: Engage with immersive cutscene narratives designed to pull you deeper into the story and connect y